This week: major UX and real-time improvements. Socket/mentions/translations got strengthened: singleton lazy Socket.IO init, hybrid auth (JWT + anonymous), robust reconnection and auto-join with normalized ObjectId; mention system fully integrated (validation, autocomplete, notifications); edited messages now include translations and validatedMentions; typing/translation dedupe & caching added; audio features improved with real-time effects, mobile recording UX, and new voice presets; notifications rebuilt with metadata & search. Many UI/accessibility fixes and i18n updates across the app.
